        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Diapering Essentials",
        "text_sha256": "d48b82a6754564c9ecab9c89a4642d27df3466c6d49fff05887893f940a53e9f",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Toys",
        "text_sha256": "fd16c1f32fde488dcf063ec7d1d22e9e410e2748242e6db165c2b982fd0cdebd",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Finding the perfect stroller can make a big difference: It’s your family’s (other) main set of wheels! Learn about the different types of strollers for your baby, from convertible strollers to lightweight strollers to full-size strollers. Take a look at travel systems for families on-the-go, double strollers for the growing family and jogging strollers for the active parent. (It’s not as complicated as it looks, promise.)",
        "text_sha256": "fc2a5e01ca24d5a7aaab1ced7ada566e6ceb356fd95d81e7751352a582b9f4af",
        "word_count": 66
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "In This Section",
        "text_sha256": "7041f45df2897ef42f226aa64587fe33b08b58486f7c2e6ef3e4b57a9f86f725",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How to Buy a Stroller",
        "text_sha256": "ecd88eded7794d5028ab3ca687726ff3f2a3c585ae5391d6d0b0e7486d29101a",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here's the good news: There are several types of strollers to choose from, and one is bound to be perfect for you. Our detailed breakdown of the different stroller types and their pros and cons can help you decide.",
        "text_sha256": "01eb0f5df6877f4b6a5155372b276ec5d6b6995ae5a7d194297c986350486a48",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Best Strollers",
        "text_sha256": "50d9cdc24b891cdd16180e1beea92058634f548efde37b4d6caededf7e577040",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Once you've decided on the best type of stroller for your family, learn which strollers moms and experts recommend. Our guides to the best strollers are broken down by type to make it easy to compare and choose.",
        "text_sha256": "ade7039e11cd515d73a5ccb9d28bfe75eae62c15269894054df8b6bebccc422a",
        "word_count": 38
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Stroller Accessories",
        "text_sha256": "5f4a0df8da0f4f68ddf7f0d3d38ff4cae377ed25a9888e37b8e205935bcb25c5",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
